[For "white"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "ruy-main 5.O-O"]
[Name "5...b5: the same position by another order"]

5... b5 { Black pushes the bishop away before anything else. This is more common than 5...Be7. }
6. Bb3 { Back to the diagonal that looks at f7. [%cal Gb3f7] }
6... Be7
7. Re1 { Guards e4. The game is back in the main line. [%cal Ge1e4] } *
